<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24240" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερ-εῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of second quality,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.49
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					2.32.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίρρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Edict.Diocl.</u>
					7.43
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut. pl.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερεῖα</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆθλα</span>), τά,
				<i>second prize</i> in a contest, hence <i>second place</i>
			or <i>rank,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ϝέμειν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερείοισι ὑπερβάλλειν</span>”
				<i>votes for second place,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.123
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				22c
			</span></i>, etc.:—later in sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2360.29
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				2759
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aphrodisias</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.133
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>secondary action,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				921b36
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
